            "review_text": "azzabarrett\nLeicester, United Kingdom297 contributions\n0\nFood was okay service was slow\nJan 2016 • Friends\nI came with a group last week (all really hungry) the food when it did arrive was okay, what you'd expect but it took well over 40 minutes for us all to receive our food.\n\nThe staff were friendly and it was well priced, but probably not worth the wait....\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 15, 2016",
