            "review_text": "portsmuf\nPortsmouth4 contributions\n0\nFeels like home!\nDec 2014 • Business\nMy colleague and I were working in Hanoi for two weeks and AThanoi became our go to restaurant. Family run, warm, impeccable service which made us feel very looked after. During our many visits whether for lunch or dinner or just a coffee, we never had a complaint and most importantly never a bad meal. The menu is varied, reasonably priced, Vietnamese and Western, with a lot of choice for veggies and they don't use MSG. Highly recommend this place if you are looking for a good feed and family type atmosphere.\nRead more\nWritten December 10, 2014",
